    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "The premise order effect is evaluated using a variety of state-of-the-art LLMs, including GPT-4-turbo, GPT-3.5-turbo, PaLM 2-L, and Gemini 1.0 Pro. The **Kendall tau distance** is used to measure the similarity between the premise order and the ground truth proof, with a value of 1 indicating the forward order and -1 indicating the backward order.",
