    {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "content": "The premise order effect has significant implications for the development of LLMs, highlighting the need for more robust and flexible reasoning capabilities. The findings also suggest that LLMs may benefit from **premise order-aware training** and **modeling techniques** to mitigate the premise order effect.",
